    "step8_outcome_verification": {
      "primary_intent": "The user wanted the agent to use Microsoft Careers to find an Applied Scientist job listing in Redmond, WA, open one relevant posting, and then accurately report four concrete details from that posting: job number, work-site arrangement, two responsibilities, and two preferred qualifications. A reasonable user would be flexible about which specific Applied Scientist listing is chosen (as long as it\u2019s relevant and includes Redmond), but would not be flexible about missing or fabricated required fields (especially the job number, responsibilities, and preferred qualifications).",
